   "ko": "간"
  },
  {
   "id": "da0205:T00103",
   "source_sha256": "cc1d7a5e8796debc9a073f49dc463b97d6e3783377e0738ba8a5f65db546f5c0",
   "ko": "다!」"
  },
  {
   "id": "da0205:T00104",
   "source_sha256": "4a761c307e5a7488cd8b955fd4aee3cc5e46aba9b52077512e574052dadd03c7",
   "ko": "「놀아 줄게, 돈키호테!」"
  },
  {
   "id": "da0205:R00023",
   "source_sha256": "762685c5877de1fec650d01e149b43d31d927091f0cdfc863f7a42fdaa190594",
   "ko": "투 소드",
   "ruby_action": "keep"
  },
  {
   "id": "da0205:T00105",
   "source_sha256": "6d535202d32daeac3c59595f60bdc6e7a35fdc0a6b9339992dbba6d4cc8baffd",
   "ko": "이도류"
  },
  {
   "id": "da0205:T00106",
   "source_sha256": "a462260bbe4958c472e72ae6f6e92fd50821544299456aa29927d68596e1305d",
   "ko": "가 달려 나간다."
  },
  {
   "id": "da0205:R00024",
   "source_sha256": "fcd73a3b569a6ba47a4e3b1161c9396aee39dc9003090ea01bcc831cacff6b92",
   "ko": "블러드",
   "ruby_action": "keep"
  },
  {
   "id": "da0205:T00107",
   "source_sha256": "81ece475c6ca76c4a4b088aad24f5ea537482205e1e900244cfcf778c1dd75a0",
   "ko": "피로 물든 기체"
  },
  {
   "id": "da0205:T00108",
   "source_sha256": "0f75ce23d04d5ad17d6f98052a91525cf92b881da46e2420b23e7c78148d1fd3",
   "ko": "가 맞아 친다.\n\n　데몬베인 vs 데몬베인."
  },
  {
   "id": "da0205:T00109",
   "source_sha256": "3d214007aa1d8d9674c453532896f001c87a7dc8b9b9b851ff4aeb517af1b086",
   "ko": "상상조차 하지 못했던, 악몽 같은 싸움이 시작되었다――!"
  }
